        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge your brain</strong> by navigating <strong>steam trains</strong> through <strong>mazes of train track</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SOLVE PUZZLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each delightful puzzle offers a satisfyingly intricate train track maze to solve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is straightforward: direct each locomotive to its matching station, but it's up to you to explore your way through the branching maze of train tracks to find the right path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch out: throw a track switch at the wrong time and your locomotives may crash!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924530/extras/1d205d9b20ad301e436f84a1c2c251d1.avif?t=1756169160\" alt=\"Steam Locomotives\" width=616 height=124 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STEAM LOCOMOTIVES GALORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy unique steam locomotive models rolling through charming railroad scenery set in the Age of Steam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome train lovers and model railroad enthusiasts—whether you love trains or just appreciate a fun puzzle, this game is for you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve 75 mind-bending train track maze puzzles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock 7 unique steam train locomotives!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your locomotive's path with a delightful array of mechanisms: switches, turntables, and an all new mechanic—sliding transfer tables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through tunnels, bridges, elevated trestles, and multi-level train track layouts that really push your puzzle-solving skills into the third dimension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Never get stuck: full solutions are available for each puzzle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Colorblind&quot; Mode is available, which allows you to match locomotives to stations using shapes instead of colors</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ALL ABOARD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a train conductor, steam locomotive engineer, and rail yard switch operator, all in one!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome kids and adults alike! The controls are straightforward and intuitive for everyone, but you'll discover depth and complexity as you progress through the puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train Maze Master is your ticket to vintage steam locomotives galore and train track maze heaven!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge your brain</strong> by navigating <strong>steam trains</strong> through <strong>mazes of train track</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SOLVE PUZZLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each delightful puzzle offers a satisfyingly intricate train track maze to solve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is straightforward: direct each locomotive to its matching station, but it's up to you to explore your way through the branching maze of train tracks to find the right path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch out: throw a track switch at the wrong time and your locomotives may crash!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924530/extras/1d205d9b20ad301e436f84a1c2c251d1.avif?t=1756169160\" alt=\"Steam Locomotives\" width=616 height=124 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STEAM LOCOMOTIVES GALORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy unique steam locomotive models rolling through charming railroad scenery set in the Age of Steam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome train lovers and model railroad enthusiasts—whether you love trains or just appreciate a fun puzzle, this game is for you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve 75 mind-bending train track maze puzzles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock 7 unique steam train locomotives!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your locomotive's path with a delightful array of mechanisms: switches, turntables, and an all new mechanic—sliding transfer tables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through tunnels, bridges, elevated trestles, and multi-level train track layouts that really push your puzzle-solving skills into the third dimension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Never get stuck: full solutions are available for each puzzle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Colorblind&quot; Mode is available, which allows you to match locomotives to stations using shapes instead of colors</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ALL ABOARD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a train conductor, steam locomotive engineer, and rail yard switch operator, all in one!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome kids and adults alike! The controls are straightforward and intuitive for everyone, but you'll discover depth and complexity as you progress through the puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train Maze Master is your ticket to vintage steam locomotives galore and train track maze heaven!</p>",
        "short_description": "Navigate steam trains through mazes of train track! Challenge your brain to solve intricate maze puzzles. Train Maze Master is your ticket to vintage steam locomotives galore and train track maze heaven!",
